  "summary": "This PR refactors multiple internal functions across chain management, block index handling, block filters, and peer processing to take `CBlockIndex` by reference instead of pointer where null arguments are prohibited. It also switches `CChain`'s internal vector storage from raw `CBlockIndex*` pointers to `std::reference_wrapper<CBlockIndex>`.",
